      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>This is a blessing written by myself and my father, Moshe Razieli, in 2021. We wrote it foremost with my brother in mind. It is also informed by my experience of working with people who have experienced trauma, loss and disability.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_42251_introduction"/>
