      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>“Blessing for Living with Chronic Illness,” by Rabbi Sandra Razieli and Moshe Razieli was written in 2021 and published for the first time here at the Open Siddur Project’s website.</tei:p>
